From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the pointer hides while typing and after a pause

`theme.cursor_hide_after_ms` and `theme.cursor_hide_when_typing` reach
the engine on `appearance`, and nothing acted on them.

- `StartPointerHiding` (`chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_pointer_hiding.cc`)
  observes aura's key, mouse, scroll and pinch events and hides or shows
  the pointer through the shared cursor client. See
  `components/domicile/browser/pointer_hiding.h`.
- Started in `PostBrowserStart`, beside `StartDeskPointer`.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
index eb1c729..c3130fc 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_activity.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_pointer.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_file_dialogs.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_pointer_hiding.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_shell_windows.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/desktop_prefs.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/rtkit.h"
@@ -1814,6 +1815,10 @@ void ChromeBrowserMainParts::PostBrowserStart() {
   // casts, which hear the pointer only over a window. Here for the same reason.
   domicile::StartDeskPointer();
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork: hides the pointer while typing and after a pause,
+  // as the desk's config says. Here for the same reason.
+  domicile::StartPointerHiding();
+
   for (auto& chrome_extra_part : chrome_extra_parts_) {
     chrome_extra_part->PostBrowserStart();
   }
